TASK: Analyze the attached crop image(s) and produce a structured visual diagnosis.

CONTEXT
- Declared crop: {{cropName}}
- Growth stage: {{growthStage}}  | Days since planting: {{daysSincePlanting|unknown}}
- Location: {{location}}  | Season: {{season}}  | Recent weather: {{recentWeather}}
