File validation (multer + manual)
Allowed MIME: image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp. Verify magic bytes (via sharp().metadata()), not just the declared MIME.
Max 4 files, max 8 MB each. Reject others with 400.
After sharp processing: resize to max 1600 px longest edge, convert to WebP quality 80, .rotate() to honor EXIF orientation, then strip metadata.
AI response schemas

Create diagnosisSchema, treatmentSchema, comparisonSchema, weeklyInsightSchema in Zod, exactly matching Section 15 JSON schemas (enums, ranges, max lengths). Add .superRefine checks:

box.x + box.w <= 1.001 and box.y + box.h <= 1.001 (clamp if slightly over, reject if grossly invalid).
imageIndex < number of uploaded images.
findings sorted check is NOT required; sort on the server instead.
If any finding has category healthy, there must be no other finding with severity above low.

On AI validation failure, apply the single repair retry in Section 13, then return 502.

